sequenceDiagram
    actor Operator
    participant Menu as Scout Menu
    participant Broker as Local Broker
    participant Scoutbot
    participant Agent as Project Agent
    participant Tools as Repo / Harness Tools

    Note over Operator,Broker: Local control plane — no model charge
    Note over Scoutbot,Tools: Model inference — plan allowance or API tokens
    Note over Scoutbot,Agent: Scout prompt, tools, AGENTS.md, skill, and reply context loaded before the turn

    Operator->>Menu: Type message
    Menu->>Broker: POST /api/send
    Broker->>Broker: Record message and routing state
    Broker-->>Menu: SSE message.posted
    Broker->>Scoutbot: Wake concierge if targeted

    alt Direct concierge answer
        Scoutbot->>Broker: messages_send
        Broker-->>Menu: SSE message.posted
    else Work needs a repo owner
        Scoutbot->>Agent: ask with project and harness
        Agent->>Tools: Read, edit, or run as granted
        Tools-->>Agent: Results
        Agent->>Broker: Progress and final reply
        Broker-->>Menu: SSE message.posted
    end

    Menu-->>Operator: Append reply
